      "start_seconds": 0.94,
      "end_seconds": 4.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.84,
      "end_seconds": 10.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.15,
      "end_seconds": 17.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Um, so... a new headache at the temple. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.45,
      "end_seconds": 21.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.49,
      "end_seconds": 25.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Ever since... since Monday, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.88,
      "end_seconds": 30.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.68,
      "end_seconds": 37.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "I'd give it a eight, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.9,
      "end_seconds": 42.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Alright, what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.71,
      "end_seconds": 45.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "I've got thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.76,
      "end_seconds": 51.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Yes. Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.7,
      "end_seconds": 56.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Yes, tramadol. I get vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.75,
      "end_seconds": 61.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.9,
      "end_seconds": 65.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Erm, my sister had breast cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.19,
      "end_seconds": 82.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.43,
      "end_seconds": 88.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.38,
      "end_seconds": 92.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.95,
      "end_seconds": 97.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.92,
      "end_seconds": 100.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.61,
      "end_seconds": 106.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Yeah, just a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.1,
      "end_seconds": 125.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.99,
      "end_seconds": 129.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "No, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.34,
      "end_seconds": 135.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Right, have you had any fever, shoulder stiffness or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.64,
      "end_seconds": 146.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "No fever, shoulder stiffness or weight loss, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.05,
      "end_seconds": 150.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.48,
      "end_seconds": 154.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.65,
      "end_seconds": 171.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.64,
      "end_seconds": 187.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.31,
      "end_seconds": 223.53,
      "duration_seconds": 16.22,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, height 161 centimetres. And BMI works out to 20.4, weight 53 kilos, pulse 86, temperature 36.9, blood pressure 114 over 74, respiratory rate 18."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.56,
      "end_seconds": 227.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.46,
      "end_seconds": 232.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "So, I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.32,
      "end_seconds": 258.38,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with possible giant cell arteritis threatening sight at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.93,
      "end_seconds": 262.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.76,
      "end_seconds": 292.72,
      "duration_seconds": 27.96,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's possible giant cell arteritis threatening sight, and we'll know more once the a temporal artery biopsy is back. A temporal artery biopsy is what I'd like next, for possible giant cell arteritis. For this, prednisolone, 60 milligrams, once a day, until review. It's for possible giant cell arteritis. Start the steroid today, this is to protect your sight."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.47,
      "end_seconds": 316.06,
      "duration_seconds": 19.59,
      "text": "Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I'd like you to see the rheumatology team as well, and I'll write the referral. Please come and see me tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.04,
      "end_seconds": 321.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.07,
      "end_seconds": 327.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Alright, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.6,
      "end_seconds": 331.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "That's clear, um, thanks."
    }
  ]
